{"speciesId":612,"names":{"fr":"Tranchodon","es":"Haxorus","en":"Haxorus","ja":"オノノクス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il est doux, mais ne pardonne pas à ceux qui viennent saccager son territoire. Ses crocs peuvent découper de l’acier."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They are kind but can be relentless when defending territory. They challenge foes with tusks that can cut steel."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses crocs sont tellement puissants qu’ils peuvent découper l’acier sans s’émousser. Son armure est très solide."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Their sturdy tusks will stay sharp even if used to cut steel beams. These Pokémon are covered in hard armor."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its tusks are incredibly destructive. They can easily slice through a thick, sturdy steel column every time."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its tusks are incredibly destructive. They can easily slice through a thick, sturdy steel column every time."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il est doux, mais ne pardonne pas à ceux qui viennent saccager son territoire. Ses crocs peuvent découper de l’acier."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Es gentil, pero no perdona a todo el que ose invadir su territorio. Su mayor baza son sus colmillos, que cortan el acero."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They are kind but can be relentless when defending territory. They challenge foes with tusks that can cut steel."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"優しい 性格だが 縄張りを 荒らす 者には 容赦しない。 鉄を 切る キバで 挑みかかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses crocs sont tellement puissants qu’ils peuvent découper l’acier sans s’émousser. Son armure est très solide."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus colmillos no se quiebran ni aunque los hinque en un armazón de acero. Está protegido por una resistente armadura."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Their sturdy tusks will stay sharp even if used to cut steel beams. These Pokémon are covered in hard armor."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"鉄骨を 切りつけても 刃こぼれ しない 頑丈な キバを 持つ。 硬い よろいに 覆われている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il est doux, mais ne pardonne pas à ceux qui viennent saccager son territoire. Ses crocs peuvent découper de l’acier."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Es gentil, pero no perdona a todo el que ose invadir su territorio. Su mayor baza son sus colmillos, que cortan el acero."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They are kind but can be relentless when defending territory. They challenge foes with tusks that can cut steel."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"優しい 性格だが 縄張りを 荒らす 者には 容赦しない。 鉄を 切る キバで 挑みかかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ses crocs sont tellement puissants qu’ils peuvent découper l’acier sans s’émousser. Son armure est très solide."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sus colmillos no se quiebran ni aunque los hinque en un armazón de acero. Está protegido por una resistente armadura."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Their sturdy tusks will stay sharp even if used to cut steel beams. These Pokémon are covered in hard armor."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"鉄骨を 切りつけても 刃こぼれ しない 頑丈な キバを 持つ。 硬い よろいに 覆われている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ses longs crocs robustes sont sa plus grande fierté. Il lèche le sol pour en absorber les minéraux et ainsi renforcer sa dentition."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su mayor baza son sus colmillos, de gran tamaño y robustez. Lame la tierra en busca de minerales para mantenerlos fuertes y resistentes."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its resilient tusks are its pride and joy. It licks up dirt to take in the minerals it needs to keep its tusks in top condition."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"頑丈な 大キバが 自慢。 強度を 保つため 土を 舐めて ミネラルを 補給する。"},{"language":"fr",